AF! It was cheesy and seasoned, something I was not expecting, so kudos! The pasta, which was either orecchiette or tortellini was al dente... not my fave..."},{"business_id":"4NidY2tw42l6iobbtai_kA","review_id":"puMZEeVxpdQlXYJQugnYTw","date":"2019-04-26T14:35:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9294042587280273,"text_excerpt":"I have no idea why this place doesn't have better reviews. I came in with a friend for the Thursday Caliente Night and sat at the bar. We ordered gulf fish tacos and shrimp tacos. They were excellent and served in super crispy shells like wonton shells. I got a strawberry jalapeno margarita (or two, or three...) to drink, which were so freaking good! I would come back here in a heartbeat. The vibe was relaxed, the staff was friendly, we weren't rushed, and the food was delicious."},{"business_id":"4NidY2tw42l6iobbtai_kA","review_id":"vAYA8zlFCzvIyoqCXfBETg","date":"2021-11-19T01:07:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287651181221008,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely zero shame in this #ThankyouThursday post. This place is admittedly only a few blocks from my apartment, so convenience factor slightly biases me, but it has been such a consistent go-to for the entire 3.5 years I have lived in the city. Smartly designed/decorated, its chic and has a fun low lit evening atmosphere with cozy couch nooks to hang with a group of friends. The drinks are consistently delicious and made with care. The food, while a sparse menu, is always super tasty. Their happy hour is bomb and goes until 8! And they also have been doing half price wine for several kk this now. And did I mention their servers/bartenders are all great?! All in all, probably our most ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4NidY2tw42l6iobbtai_kA","photo_id":"zerC86oGORAmgiK4Jrlrnw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zerC86oGORAmgiK4Jrlrnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8757964968681335},{"business_id":"4NidY2tw42l6iobbtai_kA","photo_id":"IWBxQMWRlBQVutBtuq2i2Q","label":"inside","i